# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Time Log — Environment Variables (optional)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` only if you need optional configuration.
#
# No environment variables are required to run Time Log:
# the Firebase web config lives in src/services/firebase.ts (public by design).
#
# Future (not wired yet): add VITE_SENTRY_DSN here when enabling Sentry
# error monitoring (see RECOMMENDATIONS.md).

# Optional: Firebase App Check (reCAPTCHA v3 site key). When set, Firebase only
# accepts requests coming from this website. Set it in Vercel → Settings →
# Environment Variables. See README → "Security".
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
